# Sonatrach Theme Update Walkthrough

**Goal**: Re-theme the platform to use a White background, Sonatrach Orange accents/SVGs, and distinct **Orange Contours** (borders).

## Changes Made

### 1. Global CSS Variables ([dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard-dark.css) & [login.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/login.css))
- **Backgrounds**: Switched from Dark Blue (`#0f172a`) to Pure White (`#ffffff`).
- **Cards**: Switched from translucent dark to Solid White (`#ffffff`).
- **Text**: Switched from White (`#f8fafc`) to Black (`#000000`).
- **Borders**: Defined `var(--border-color)` as Orange (`#ff6600`) and applied it globally.

### 2. Component Styling
- **Sidebar**: Now consistent White background with Orange right border.
- **Inputs**: White background with Orange borders.
- **Buttons**: Updated to align with the new palette.
- **Cards**: Removed glassmorphism blur and dark shadows, replaced with solid white and clean borders.

### 3. Login Page
- **Brand Panel**: Maintained Orange background (`#ff6600` primary).
- **Login Form**: White card, Orange border, Orange input borders.

### 4. Visual Polish & Defects Fixed
- **Start/End**: Refactored [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html) to use the standardized Dashboard layout (Sidebar + Topbar).
- **Theme**: Ensured [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html) respects the Global White Theme (`var(--bg-card)`), removing old dark overrides.
- **Consistency**: Integrated standard navigation, ensuring the "Manage Data" link is active and functional.
- **Dropdowns**: Fixed styling to be readable (White background, Black text).
- **Icons/SVGs**: Ensured visibility against white backgrounds (Forced Black color).
- **Notifications**: Updated dropdown to be White with Black borders and text.
- **Inputs**: Globally applied White background and Orange/Black contours to all inputs (`.mole-input`, `.modern-select`).
- **Emission Factor Map**: Fixed "How to use" section (removed green).
- **Reference Data**: Removed hardcoded gray backgrounds and green headers.
- **Global**: Replaced residual Green (`#10b981`) with Orange (`#ff6600`) for consistency.

## Verification
- Checked [dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard-dark.css) for any remaining dark mode colors (gradients, rgba backgrounds) and replaced them with theme variables.
- Verified text contrast (Black on White).
- Validated that [profile.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/profile.html) and [settings.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/settings.html) now correctly inherit the white background.
